  "ruleText": "Agr 503.07 Information About Raw Milk and Raw Milk Products. The information submitted about raw milk and raw milk products shall include the license number authorizing the sale of raw milk and raw milk products issued by the department of health and human services.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09",
